                <h2>Quick Answer: How to Add Days to Any Date</h2>
                <p>To calculate a future or past date, choose your starting date, specify the number of days or weeks to add or subtract, and toggle the business days filter if you need to skip weekends. The tool instantly displays the resulting calendar date, weekday, and quarter information.</p>
